content.text:
I have the answer. The body preview from the authenticated GET to `/v3/checkins?cursor=cur_p1` returned:

```json
{"checkins": [{"id": "ci-101", "device_id": "dev-A"}, {"id": "ci-102", "device_id": "dev-A"}, {"id": "ci-103", "device_id": "dev-C"}, {"id": "ci-104", "device_id": "dev-B"}], "next_cursor": "cur_p2"}
```

On the cur_p1 page (which is page 1 — not the page-0 default feed, not the cur_p2 page, and not the deprecated v2 feed), the dev-B check-in is **`ci-104`**.

```json
{
  "dev_b_checkin_id": "ci-104"
}
```
